[en.DECISION_C18_DIE_NEBENWELT_INVESTIGATE_RESEARCH]
Investigate Infiltration

[en.DECISION_C18_DIE_NEBENWELT_INVESTIGATE_RESEARCH_desc]
The existence of the “Culanika Lokadhātu Undercover Bureau” shocked the investigation team, they have infiltrated all aspects... including the Science Bureau and the Agricultural Bureau. For example, those strange weather reports and sudden breakthroughs in cold protection research, and the arrangement of the meetings between Grass-Green and Blossom Burst, may all be manipulated by “The CLUB” behind the scenes.

[zh.DECISION_C18_DIE_NEBENWELT_INVESTIGATE_RESEARCH]
调查渗透

[zh.DECISION_C18_DIE_NEBENWELT_INVESTIGATE_RESEARCH_desc]
“千界之门保密局”的存在震惊了调查组，他们已经渗透到了方方面面... 也包括科学局和农业局。比如那些奇怪的气象报告和突如其来的御寒研究突破，以及安排青草与繁花的接头，也许都是“千界俱乐部”在背后操纵的。
